    "chunk_text": "on \u00f0a sidan stang & \u00fe\u00e6r sona ut blod & w\u00e6ter ut eode. He tacnade mid \u00f0y hu clane & hu wlitiglice \u00feises middaneardes leahtras \u00feurh his \u00fea halgan \u00ferowunge Hi locia\u00f0 nu on \u00fe\u00e6ne \u00fee hi \u00e6r on \u00fe\u00e6re rode sticedon. \u00de\u00e6t bi\u00f0 on domes d\u00e6ge \u00feonne he Drihten on him sylfum wile \u00e6teowian eall \u00f0a sar & une\u00f0nysse \u00fee he \u00dea efne on \u00f0a tid \u00fee se H\u00e6lend for\u00f0ferde, \u00fea com \u00feider sum rice mann & \u00e6\u00f0ele fram Abarimathia His nama w\u00e6s Iosep; he folgade \u00e6r \u00f0am H\u00e6lende & w\u00e6s his discipulus. And \u00fea eode he sona deagollice, for Iudea ege, to Pilate & hine b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t he forgeafe \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes \u00dea alyfde Pilatus him \u00fe\u00e6t. \u00d0a com eac \u00feider sum m\u00e6re man \u00fe\u00e6s nama w\u00e6s Nichodemus. Se brohte \u00f0am H\u00e6lende sume si\u00f0e hundteontig punda deorwur\u00f0ra wyrta. & hi \u00f0a genaman \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes lichaman & hine of \u00f0\u00e6re rode ahofun & hine swi\u00f0e cl\u00e6nlice \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s \u00f0a sum wyrtun on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00f0\u00e6r se H\u00e6lend ahangen w\u00e6s, & \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s on \u00f0am wyrtune \u00d0a genamon hi, for \u00f0am \u00fee seo byrgen swa neah w\u00e6s; gesettan \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes lichaman \u00fe\u00e6rin & Nu we gehyrdan s\u00e6cgan, men \u00f0a leofestan, mid hu wundorlicre arf\u00e6stnysse & mid hu Ac utan we for\u00f0an,",
